# Six 24x24 frames on one strip, drawn at 2x: warrior, archer, tank — in blue
# for the player, then the same three in red.
#
# Painted like painted miniatures: three values, chunky, no faces. That is the
# conceit of the whole game — these are pieces on a table, and the player is a
# pair of hands. Anything that made one of them characterful would work against
# the fact that they fight without you.
#
# The three classes differ by silhouette, not by decoration: a wide-shouldered
# warrior, a narrow archer, a low slab of a tank. During combat they are 48px
# and moving, and silhouette is all that survives that.
name autobattler-units
size 144 24
key o outline
key a ally-1
key A ally-2-hilite
key s ally-0-shadow
key f foe-1
key F foe-2-hilite
key t foe-0-shadow
pixels
